  "content_id": "16136215",
  "title": "Coreum Network Fees",
  "description": "Coreum (COREUM) – Next-Gen Enterprise Blockchain\nCoreum focuses on high scalability for business and DeFi use cases.\nHow Coreum Fees Work\n...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSZ4V9A1HY8JDPP92JES8BZC\">Coreum (COREUM) – Next-Gen Enterprise Blockchain</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Coreum focuses on high scalability for business and DeFi use cases.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ4V9A113Z2DQ2R5ZNN0MEB\">How Coreum Fees Work</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Gas model</b> similar to Cosmos</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Paid in COREUM tokens</b>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge calculates optimal gas usage per transaction type.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ4V9A12TVE2675BVKRFN9S\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>High</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Optimal (default)</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Low</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Custom</b></p></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ4V9A15NECZ153BZWHENX7\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">About <b>$0.01 to $0.03 USD</b>.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ4V9A1X5WJ5BGGVQ3N49B0\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Coreum is designed for mass-scale apps, and Edge ensures your fees stay light, fast, and appropriate for both small and large transactions.</p>",
